{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160@rel:R19-11#0779df7f","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","release":"R19-11","content":"On invocation of EthTSyn_RxIndication() the ingress timestamp t2 shall be retrieved from the EthIf via EthIf_GetIngressTimeStamp() on ingress of the Pdelay_Req message according to Figure 8 , if EthTSynHardwareTimestampSupport ( ECUC_EthTSyn_00018 : ) is set to TRUE . Specification of Time Synchronization over Ethernet AUTOSAR CP R19 - 11 22 of 83 Document ID 676 : AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverEthernet - AUTOSAR confidential - If the StbM does not use the Ethernet controller as source for the Virtual Local Time (refer to parameter StbMLocalTimeHardware , ECUC _StbM_00053 , in [4] ), the EthTSyn shall convert the ingress time stamp to the Virtual Local Time as used in the StbM.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverEthernet.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:12:23+00:00"},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160@rel:R20-11#b3ceb292","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","release":"R20-11","content":"On invocation of EthTSyn_RxIndication() the ingress timestamp t2 shall be retrieved from the EthIf via EthI f_GetIngressTimeStamp() on ingress of the Pdelay_Req message according to Figure 7 , if EthTSynHardwareTimestampSupport ( ECUC_EthTSyn_00018 : ) is set to TRUE . If the StbM does not use the Etherne t controller as source for the Virtual Local Time (refer to parameter StbMLocalTimeHardware , ECUC_StbM_00053 , in [4] ), the EthTSyn shall convert the ingress time stamp to the Virtual Local Time as used in the StbM.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverEthernet.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:12:42+00:00"},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160@rel:R21-11#5500cf5b","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","release":"R21-11","content":"On invocation of EthTSyn_RxIndication the ingress timestamp t2 shall be retrieved from the EthIf via EthIf_GetIngressTimeStamp on ingress of the Pdelay_Req message, if EthTSynHardwareTimestampSupport is set to TRUE. If the StbM does not use the Ethernet controller as source for the Virtual Local Time (refer to parameter StbMLocalTimeHardware in [2]), the EthTSyn shall convert the ingress time stamp to the Virtual Local Time as used in the StbM.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverEthernet.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:13:07+00:00"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","release":"R22-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","release":"R25-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_EthTSyn_00160","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R19-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":[],"platform_releases":["R18-10","R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11","text_releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11"],"presence_only":["R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"unchecked":["R18-10"]},"element":{"kind":"requirement","name":"","module":"EthTSyn","cluster":"","page":"","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R19-11","last":"R25-11","changed":["R20-11","R21-11"],"distinct":3,"universe":"CP"},"evidence":{"figures":[{"id":"FIG-74f525aabe8503c4","